   485                              <2> ; second, independently-phased X-axis tumble, then scales the whole
   486                              <2> ; shape by a sine-driven Z-plane zoom before placing it at the current
   487                              <2> ; dance center. Writes the same octa_screen_x/y and octa_rot_z arrays
